Subject: [PATCH 17/19] Show the bar'\''s cover in Now Playing instead of
 downloading it again

---
 Spotifly/Store/Entities.swift               |  7 --
 Spotifly/ViewModels/PlaybackViewModel.swift | 81 +++++++++++----------
 Spotifly/Views/Components/SharedImage.swift | 15 +++-
 Spotifly/Views/NowPlayingBarView.swift      |  5 +-
 4 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 51 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Spotifly/Store/Entities.swift b/Spotifly/Store/Entities.swift
